ade.price_change_line}}</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>{{ab_cart_edd_upgrade.renewal_line}} You won’t be charged twice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If something went wrong at checkout, just reply and we’ll fix it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Zack Katz<br>Founder, GravityKit</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>P.S. Not sure the bigger plan is right for you? <a href=\"https://www.gravitykit.com/consultation/\">Book a free 1-on-1 call with me</a> and we’ll work out what fits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n",
